      "id": "0c5503a",
      "elType": "widget",
      "widgetType": "text-editor",
      "isInner": false,
      "settings": {
       "editor": "<p>Founded in 1994 as a company primarily managing artists in the music industry and providing legal services to companies and organizations in the music sector, RAM Management has grown to provide legal counsel to all areas of business.</p>",
